quiz_w3.md#29:
@q 3 :: w3-definisi :: w3-c-definisi
Persamaan customer value versi slide W3 adalah ...
- Customer Value = Persepsi Kualitas − Persepsi Risiko
+ Customer Value = Persepsi Kualitas / Persepsi Risiko
- Customer Value = Persepsi Risiko / Persepsi Kualitas
- Customer Value = Persepsi Kualitas × Persepsi Risiko
@why
